/// render + one optional directional shadow map (PL1b). shadow=(light_index,map): the map's
/// light must be lights[light_index] and directional. The map supplies light-space bounds and
/// texel constants (same values drive lit_raster/textured_bvh); the GPU rasterizes its own
/// depth pre-pass at the map's resolution. CPU fallback renders UNSHADOWED and says so in Status.
